==Trivia==
===Origin===
*This card features the [[Alolan form]] of {{p|Raichu}}.
*This card's illustration was first featured on {{TCG ID|Crimson Invasion|Alolan Raichu|31}} from the {{TCG|Crimson Invasion}} expansion; both cards have the Surge Surfer {{TCG|Ability}}.
*{{a|Surge Surfer}} is an [[Ability]] in the [[Pokémon games]] that Alolan Raichu can have.
*'''Thunder Spear''' is an attack that first appeared on {{TCG ID|EX Sandstorm|Electabuzz|35}} from the {{TCG|EX Sandstorm}} expansion.
*This card's [[Pokédex]] entry comes from {{g|Shield}}.

